<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/7/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_c__subpara_ii> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for the definition of \"admission to an entertainment\" the following definition: ' \"admission to an entertainment\" includes admission to any place in which an entertainment is held or any other place from which a person would be able to be a spectator or one of the audience of an entertainment, and also includes being given the right to use an entertainment facility;'; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/7/eng@> .
